\f4\b\fs32 \cf0 \ul \ulc0 Creation of Maven Java Project\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone Step 1.
\f1\b0  Open Eclipse IDE\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  1.1. Launch Eclipse workspace\

\f4\b Step 2
\f1\b0 . Install Maven Plugin (if not installed)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1. Go to "Help" in the top menu\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1.1. Click "Eclipse Marketplace"\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1.2. Search for "Maven Integration for Eclipse"\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1.3. Install the plugin if not already installed\

\f4\b Step 3
\f1\b0 . Create a New Maven Project\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  3.1. File -> New -> Project...\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  3.1.1. Expand "Maven"\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  3.1.2. Select "Maven Project" and click "Next"\

\f4\b Step 4
\f1\b0 . Set Project Configuration\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  4.1. Select workspace location (default or custom)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  4.2. Click "Next"\

\f4\b Step 5
\f1\b0 . Choose Maven Archetype\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  5.1. Select an archetype(e.g "org.apache.maven.archetypes -> maven-archetype-quickstart 1.4 ")\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  5.2. Click "Next"\

\f4\b Step 
\f1\b0 6. Define Project Metadata\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  6.1. Group ID: (e.g., com.example)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  6.2. Artifact ID: (e.g., my-maven-project)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  6.3. Version: (default is usually fine)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  6.4. Click "Finish"\

\f4\b In Console, artifacts are grouped. When prompted with Y/N, type 'Y'.\
Step 7
\f1\b0 . Maven Project Created\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  7.1. Project structure is generated with a standard Maven layout\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  7.2. Includes:\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  src/main/java (for Java source code)\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  src/test/java (for test code)\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  pom.xml (Maven configuration file)\

\f4\b Step 8
\f1\b0 . Update Project Settings (if needed)\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  8.1. Right-click on the project -> Maven -> Update Project...\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  8.2. Ensure dependencies are up to date\

\f4\b Step 9
\f1\b0 . Build and Run Maven Project\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  9.1. Right-click on App.java -> Run As -> Maven Clean\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  9.1.1. Right-click on App.java -> Run As -> Maven Install\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  9.1.2. Right-click on App.java -> Run As -> Maven Test\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  9.1.3. Right-click on App.java -> Run As -> Maven Build\

\f4\b Step 10
\f1\b0 . In the Maven Build dialog:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Enter Goals: clean install test\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Click on Apply -> Click on Run\

\f4\b Step 11
\f1\b0 . Check console for BUILD SUCCESS message.\

\f4\b Step 12
\f1\b0 . Run the application:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on App.java -> Run As -> Java Application\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Output: "Hello World" displayed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\b\fs32 \cf0 \ul Creation of Maven web Java Project
\f1\b0\fs24 \ulnone \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf0 Step 1
\f1\b0 : Open Eclipse\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  1.1 Launch Eclipse IDE.\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  1.2 Select or create a workspace.\

\f4\b Step 2
\f1\b0 : Create a New Maven Project\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1. File -> New -> Project...\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1.1. Expand "Maven"\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  2.1.2. Select "Maven Project" and click "Next"\

\f4\b Step 3
\f1\b0 : Choose Maven Archetype\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  3.1. Select an archetype(e.g "'org.apache.maven.archetypes' -> 'maven-archetype-webapp' 1.4 ")\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  3.2. Click "Next"\

\f4\b Step 4
\f1\b0 : Configure the Maven Project\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  4.1 Group Id: Enter a group ID (e.g., com.example).\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  4.2 Artifact Id: Enter an artifact ID (e.g., my-web-app).\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  4.3 Click **Finish** to create the project.\

\f4\b Step 5
\f1\b0 : Add Maven Dependencies\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  5.1 Open the **pom.xml** file in the Maven project.\
\'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  5.2 Add the necessary dependencies for your web project (e.g., Servlet, JSP):\

\f4\b Go to browser -> Open mvnrepository.com\
Search for 'Java Servlet API' -> Select the latest version.\
Copy the dependency code -> Paste it in MavenWeb\'92s pom.xml under the target folder\

\f1\b0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Example:\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 ```xml\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 <dependency>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 <groupId>javax.servlet</groupId>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 <artifactId>javax.servlet-api</artifactId>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 <version>4.0.1</version>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 <scope>provided</scope>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 </dependency>\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 ```\
\'a0 
\f4\b Step 6
\f1\b0 :-. Configure server:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Window -> Show View -> Servers\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Add server -> Select Tomcat v9.0 server -> Click Next\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Configure server options (e.g., ports, server location).\

\f4\b Step 7
\f1\b0 :-. Modify 'tomcat-users.xml':\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Add role and user details under <tomcat-users> tag.\

\f4\b Step 8
\f1\b0 :. Build the project:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on index.jsp -> Run As -> Maven Clean\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on index.jsp -> Run As -> Maven Install\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on index.jsp -> Run As -> Maven Test\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on index.jsp -> Run As -> Maven Build\

\f4\b Step 9
\f1\b0 . In the Maven Build dialog:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Enter Goals: clean install test\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Click on Apply -> Click on Run\

\f4\b Step 10
\f1\b0 . Check console for BUILD SUCCESS message.\

\f4\b Step 11
\f1\b0 . Run the application:\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Right-click on index.jsp -> Run As -> Run on Server\
\'a0 \'a0\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  Select the Tomcat server -> Click on Finish\

\f4\b Step 12
\f1\b0 . Output: "Hello World" webpage displayed.\

\f4\b Note:-Now push yours Maven java project and Maven Web Project into your github\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

